# Normalize line endings in the repo and on checkout.
#
# public/assets/maps/level_01.json is validated for reproducibility by SHA256,
# and the generator writes LF. Without this, Git's Windows autocrlf rewrites the
# checked-out file to CRLF, which both dirties the tree after every
# `npm run map:generate` and breaks cross-machine hash comparisons.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
